{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=790 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.mp4?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is a new type of crafting multiplayer shooter. Board a colossal megatrain with your crew at the back, scavenge and build compact makeshift bases, push forward for better gear, then retreat to your Dagger shuttle to grow stronger and climb the train classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5d339c661bf95ea75490eed0a3fd3534.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5d339c661bf95ea75490eed0a3fd3534.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall takes place entirely on colossal moving trains. From cramped tail slums to lavish first-class cars and guarded engine rooms, every carriage is a living space to loot, fight over, turn into a base, or eventually claim as part of your own rolling home as you climb from tailie to conductor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/89873113299a708f29972fe8428355f0.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/89873113299a708f29972fe8428355f0.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/54f567390fd13e1dd61a77ffe2158fec.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/54f567390fd13e1dd61a77ffe2158fec.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is built around human opponents and allies. Raid trains with friends, defend your makeshift bases, and clash with other players over key routes and resources, with every encounter having the potential to flip from cooperation to conflict in a heartbeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76fee0adf12d04c9d9e7b25c28a030e6.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76fee0adf12d04c9d9e7b25c28a030e6.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/1f04b8a83889df9b842952ffe7de81b2.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/1f04b8a83889df9b842952ffe7de81b2.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge as you go and turn whatever you find into useful gear, armor, and structures. Throw together compact bases for respawns and storage, craft upgraded gear as you move up the train, and adjust your loadout on the fly instead of sticking to a single pre-set build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/b8466e0d038a208fcbcd96ddf4f026fb.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/b8466e0d038a208fcbcd96ddf4f026fb.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your Dagger shuttle from a rust bucket to a sleek assault craft, and eventually take control of a fully player-owned Marauder train. Expand from a single carriage into a chain of workshops, bunk rooms, and gun decks, then keep it supplied by hitting Titan trains and defending your moving fortress from rival conductors with your crew beside you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2437390?t=1771155138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/8428e9f20979532879bae8e0460742e94cdf1f03/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771155138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/c5c3b80b2ae0536a44a10a09c323cc68e31d2f3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771155138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/c5c3b80b2ae0536a44a10a09c323cc68e31d2f3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771155138","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violent content with the presence of blood, as well as voice chat support."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=790 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.mp4?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is a new type of crafting multiplayer shooter. Board a colossal megatrain with your crew at the back, scavenge and build compact makeshift bases, push forward for better gear, then retreat to your Dagger shuttle to grow stronger and climb the train classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5d339c661bf95ea75490eed0a3fd3534.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5d339c661bf95ea75490eed0a3fd3534.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall takes place entirely on colossal moving trains. From cramped tail slums to lavish first-class cars and guarded engine rooms, every carriage is a living space to loot, fight over, turn into a base, or eventually claim as part of your own rolling home as you climb from tailie to conductor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/89873113299a708f29972fe8428355f0.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/89873113299a708f29972fe8428355f0.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/54f567390fd13e1dd61a77ffe2158fec.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/54f567390fd13e1dd61a77ffe2158fec.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enginefall is built around human opponents and allies. Raid trains with friends, defend your makeshift bases, and clash with other players over key routes and resources, with every encounter having the potential to flip from cooperation to conflict in a heartbeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76fee0adf12d04c9d9e7b25c28a030e6.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76fee0adf12d04c9d9e7b25c28a030e6.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/1f04b8a83889df9b842952ffe7de81b2.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/1f04b8a83889df9b842952ffe7de81b2.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge as you go and turn whatever you find into useful gear, armor, and structures. Throw together compact bases for respawns and storage, craft upgraded gear as you move up the train, and adjust your loadout on the fly instead of sticking to a single pre-set build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/b8466e0d038a208fcbcd96ddf4f026fb.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/b8466e0d038a208fcbcd96ddf4f026fb.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.poster.avif?t=1771155138\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.webm?t=1771155138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your Dagger shuttle from a rust bucket to a sleek assault craft, and eventually take control of a fully player-owned Marauder train. Expand from a single carriage into a chain of workshops, bunk rooms, and gun decks, then keep it supplied by hitting Titan trains and defending your moving fortress from rival conductors with your crew beside you.</p>","developers":["Red Rover Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/84f398545b750b603bbcea792b5d785ce187f775/header.jpg?t=1771155138","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>Video features 'Future Earth' font</strong> Dafont, licensed CC BY-ND","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2437390/1176061196/632edf8c984a23aa6036bafe4f5d804a3c8392b0/1765230240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765234260","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2437390/1176061196/632edf8c984a23aa6036bafe4f5d804a3c8392b0/1765230240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765234260","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2437390/1176061196/632e